    {
      "part": "root",
      "element": "button",
      "notes": "36x36 day cell. Auto-layout frame (HORIZONTAL, center-aligned) with fill, 1px stroke, and 8px corner radius, all state-driven. Figma includes a 'Left Icon' and 'Right Icon' INSTANCE slot (icon-holder pattern) as the first/last child of every one of the 5 state variants, but both are set to visible:false in all 5 states with no exception. They render nothing in any variant, so they are intentionally excluded from this anatomy (and from adapter output) to avoid emitting dead/hidden markup. If a future Figma revision makes them visible in some state, re-run the extractor to pick them up."
    },
